{"id":"vod_md_5189","vodId":"5189","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"约定的梦幻岛粤语版","name_cn":"约定的梦幻岛粤语版","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230919-1/58ddbd422422e888d793cd18d776f0e7.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为恩典农场的孤儿院内，在这里生活着很多失去了亲人，无家可归的孩子们，他们共有36人，每天，在劳作和玩耍之余，孩子们还要进行学习和测验，其中，佼佼者是名为艾玛（诸星堇 配音）的女孩和名为诺曼（内田真礼 配音）的男孩。负责管理和看护这些孩子们的女性名叫伊莎贝拉（甲斐田裕子 配音），孩子们喜欢喊她“妈妈”。每过一段时间，都会有一个孩子被收养离开农场，生活在这里的孩子们都将此作为自己的人生目标。一次偶然中，艾玛发现了隐藏在这座孤儿院背后的秘密，那些离开的孩子根本就没有被领养，而是被屠宰了，生活在恩典农场的孩子们，其实就是这座农场所饲养的“牲畜”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-19 08:33:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/z0qn8lc8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/Db1iLTPv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/318Mui3c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/TWl0trBs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/UbRaEiqc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/XLxurdNP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/nYLmHvtS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/xlAELuO7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/BT2HzF7Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/Ep9YUzL9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/oOicYImY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/JGpxsy0h/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:05.753Z"}